{
  "dom_id": "step-q88759",
  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "What function represents a stretch of factor $5$ and invariant $x$-axis, followed by a stretch of factor $2$ and invariant $y$-axis?",
  "worked_solution": "- A stretch of factor $5$ and invariant $x$-axis can be represented by the function\n\n$$\n(x,y)↦(x,5y).\n$$\n\n- A stretch of factor $2$ and invariant $y$-axis can be represented by the function\n\n$$\n(x,y)↦(2x,y).\n$$\n\nTherefore, the combination of the stretches is given by\n\n$$\n(x,y)↦(2x,5y).\n$$",
